impl-openai.orchestratorPrompt:
@impl-openai - GPT-6.2 Sol Ultrafast High implementer, the default lane, 3 standing slots.
- **Delegate when:** any bounded, well-specified task: mechanical or multi-file edits, a single function or module, tests for existing behavior, renames, wiring.
- **Do not delegate when:** the task is big or open-ended (use @impl-claude), genuinely hard (use @impl-hard), or trivial enough to do yourself.

verifier.orchestratorPrompt:
@verifier - Haiku 5.5 High checker, the check half of a work/check loop.
- **Delegate when:** an implementer returns from a loop item whose evaluation is more than one quick command, or whose change spans several files. Send the same loop item, the changed files and the round number. On FAIL, continue the same implementer session with the findings verbatim, then send its next pass back to the same @verifier session.
- **Do not delegate when:** the evaluation is a single cheap command (rerun it yourself), the lane was read-only, or the question is the quality of the whole change (that is @reviewer, once, after the loops).

